{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0013_guard_the_refusal_heuristic", "label": "ADR 0013: Detect refusals with a guarded heuristic rather than letting them through", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-guard-the-refusal-heuristic.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "adr_id": "0013", "status": "Accepted", "date": "2026-08-19"}, {"id": "docs_adr_0013_guard_the_refusal_heuristic_refusal_heuristic", "label": "Refusal heuristic", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-guard-the-refusal-heuristic.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A refusal is a valid string, and given the NSFW use case refusals are common, so the phrase list (i'm sorry, i cannot, i can't, i am unable, i'm unable, i apologise/ize, as an ai; U+2018/U+2019 apostrophes and 'i am sorry' accepted) converts 'I'm sorry, but I can't describe this image' into DescriptionRefusedError instead of garbage alt text. Documented as a heuristic; the cleaned text is on .response. Start-anchored on the cleaned text because decoration in front would defeat an anchored pattern."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0013_guard_the_refusal_heuristic_refusal_guard", "label": "Refusal guard (under 200 chars OR no '.' before index 60)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-guard-the-refusal-heuristic.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fires only when a refusal phrase starts the cleaned text AND the text looks like a refusal sentence rather than a description that happens to open 'I cannot see'. OR so a long run-on refusal still fires. Accepted false positive: a short description opening with such a phrase, since the prompt forbids that opening and refusals are the common case. Dropping the heuristic was offered at sign-off (Q4) and rejected."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0013_guard_the_refusal_heuristic", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_19_describe_it_design", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-guard-the-refusal-heuristic.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0013_guard_the_refusal_heuristic", "target": "docs_adr_0013_guard_the_refusal_heuristic_refusal_heuristic", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-guard-the-refusal-heuristic.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0013_guard_the_refusal_heuristic", "target": "docs_adr_0013_guard_the_refusal_heuristic_refusal_guard", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-guard-the-refusal-heuristic.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0013_guard_the_refusal_heuristic_refusal_heuristic", "target": "docs_adr_0013_guard_the_refusal_heuristic_refusal_guard", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-guard-the-refusal-heuristic.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0013_guard_the_refusal_heuristic_refusal_heuristic", "target": "src_describe_it_prompt_looks_like_refusal", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-guard-the-refusal-heuristic.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0013_guard_the_refusal_heuristic_refusal_guard", "target": "src_describe_it_prompt_looks_like_refusal", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-guard-the-refusal-heuristic.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0013_guard_the_refusal_heuristic_refusal_heuristic", "target": "src_describe_it_prompt_clean_response", 